EXAMPLE PAYLOAD AND FORMAT FOR SAME VERSION RESTORE:
{
  "purpose" : "Testing restore API",
 "inputParameters" : {
 "podName" : "ELNK",
 "backupName" : "TEST_DEMO",
 "isSameVersionRestore" : "true",
 "emailNotifications":"Demo user025@example.com"
 }
}**All the fields in the above format not marked as optional are necessary and must be passed with valid values.**

* **For GRP restore OR N-1.**

**Note : isSameVersionRestore needs to be false**

EXAMPLE PAYLOAD AND FORMAT FOR SAME VERSION RESTORE:
{
  "purpose" : "Testing restore API",
    "inputParameters" : {
 "podName" : "ELNK",
 "isSameVersionRestore" : "false",
 "emailNotifications":"Demo user025@example.com"
 }
}**All the fields in the above format not marked as optional are necessary and must be passed with valid values.**

### **OUTPUT**

Output{
 "status": "SUCCESS",
 "message": "<preflight-id>"
}

For Preflight Pod: https://api.example.com/reference/resource-241
For Family Pod: https://api.example.com/reference/resource-242 **Payload Format:**

EXAMPLE PAYLOAD AND FORMAT:
{
 "purpose" : "Testing backup API",
 "inputParameters" : {
 "podName" : "PNTIBBEQY",
 "backupName" : "TEST_DEMO" , //Optional, auto-generated if not provided
 "emailNotifications":"Demo user025@example.com",
 "monitoringagentMonitor": true/false //To automatically invoke monitoringagent monitoring
 }
}
**All the fields in the above format not marked as optional are necessary and must be passed with valid values.**

### **OUTPUT**

Output{
 "status": "SUCCESS",
 "message": "<preflight-id>"
}  

